{"id":"7571e570a84c5e37","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-prop-name.md","title":"Name Properties","display":"prop-name — Name Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-name","aliases":["58-prop-name"],"display":"prop-name — Name Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[58-prop-forcing-definition.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-name — Name Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name.md\">58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7b18d50e9dafc3fd\" href=\"?note=7b18d50e9dafc3fd\" title=\"58-prop-forcing-definition.md\">58-prop-forcing-definition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,\\dot y,p,q\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,\\dot y,p,q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,P)\\)</span> (forcing-name predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\operatorname{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (model and poset predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> (canonical forcing-relation predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,P)\\land p\\in P\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot x,\\dot y\\rangle,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,q,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot x,\\dot y\\rangle,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,P)\\land p\\in P\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot x,\\dot y\\rangle,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,q,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot x,\\dot y\\rangle,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forward implication is downward persistence of the six-place forcing relation; the reverse implication uses reflexivity, taking <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=p\">\\(q=p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The statement concerns equality of two well-formed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names in a typed forcing setup.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-prop-forcing-definition.md","status":"resolved","id":"7b18d50e9dafc3fd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-prop-forcing-definition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,\\dot y,p,q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot y,P)\\land p\\in P\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot x,\\dot y\\rangle,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,q,\\ulcorner v_0=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot x,\\dot y\\rangle,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q=p","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1507,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3981","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-prop-name.md|58-prop-name]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["ec28b62254928d73","66d43bb76d055059","d3f859dbdd37f018","911508dbd8495663","7b18d50e9dafc3fd","65418b505fc53093"]}